AHV Remote Console
Copyright (c) 2026 Errevi S.p.A.

This product is a custom integration built on the Nutanix AHV virtualization
stack. It talks to Nutanix Prism (the v3 REST API and the VNC console), mounts
an agent ISO into guest virtual machines, and includes modifications that change
how those vendor components are used. It is not a Nutanix product, and it has
not been reviewed, endorsed or supported by Nutanix, Inc.

Nutanix, AHV, Prism and Nutanix Guest Tools are trademarks of Nutanix, Inc. They
are named in this repository only to describe compatibility. This repository
does not contain Nutanix source code or binaries.

